---Get Quote (Exact Out)
---
---Destination-amount ("reverse") quote. Given a target fiat payout
---(`exactAmountOut`), returns — for every withdrawal speed — how much of the
---input token the merchant needs to send so that, after swap, gas and
---withdraw fees, the withdrawer nets exactly that payout. A speed is
---`undefined` when it isn't available for the requested payout (no
---providers, unsupported currency, over the limit, or unreachable).
---
---This is the inverse of `GET /withdraw/quote`.
---
---`GET /withdraw/quote/exact-out`
---@param input coinflow.withdraw.GetExactOutQuoteRequest
---@return coinflow.withdraw.RecordWithdrawSpeedWithdrawExactOutQuoteOrUndefined? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_exact_out_quote(input) end

